  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bed64995-35fb-5f1d-8e94-14667aca5890" activityNameId="e30228db-a59d-511f-965b-95f152185bab" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silver, from copper production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silver, from copper production, at refinery
The multi-output-process "processing of anode slime, primary copper production" delivers the co-products "copper telluride cement, from copper production" and "silver, from copper production, at refinery". The product "copper telluride cement, …" is an intermediary in the production of telluride and is not to be used by the LCA practitioner.  The flow "silver, …" is a by-product of this process that receives part of the burdens allocated. The dataset must not be used to reflect silver. For Tellurium and Silver the respective adequate enduser datasets have to be chosen.;
UUID: ebb12c68-5341-3ea9-96af-cc80bf625ba2
Generation of anode slime from primary copper production (input), leaching and precipitation of copper telluride, melting and electrolysis of silver
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Leaching of anode slime from primary copper production and precipitation of copper telluride on copper choppings, melting of residues with subsequent Moebius electrolysis.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ebb12c68-5341-3ea9-96af-cc80bf625ba2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
